        "content": "### \ud83d\uded1 Active IPS Queues, ARP Traps & Dead-Letter Diagnostics\n* **Active Pi-hole Blocks & Retry Queue:** Tracks domains actively blocked or pending retry verification.\n* **Dead-Letter Failures:** Lists domains permanently failed after maximum API retries.\n* **Active ARP Tarpits:** Lists local MAC addresses held in Layer-2 ARP blackholes."
